# Frozen 2026-09-15, the first run with `--ratchets` on: shell functions the
# scanner sees no caller for. Two-way: a frozen function that gains a caller in
# the corpus, or is deleted, is STALE and its line goes.
# Format: <file>	<function>.
#
# codeql_analyze_java is CALLERLESS ON PURPOSE since 0364703 (2026-09-15).
# codeql-android.sh stopped asking for a java/kotlin database because CodeQL's
# Java extractor injects a Kotlin compiler plugin with a hard upper bound below
# this repo's declared KGP, and against it the whole Gradle BUILD dies - not
# just the scan (run 34870931651, task
# :kataglyphis_native_inference:compileReleaseKotlin). The function is kept so
# restoring the scan is one line in codeql-android.sh rather than a rewrite; the
# comment at codeql-android.sh:10 names the dispatch site and the condition
# (CodeQL's ceiling clearing 2.4.20) under which this row goes.

scripts/linux/codeql/codeql-common.sh	codeql_analyze_java
